   "doc": "SL5g #3 — failure-cause classification of VLA-only success -> pb4/pb5 failure episodes (CPU, .venv-ag3s).\n\nInputs: failure_logs.json, mj_probe_LI.json, mj_probe_LIBERO10.json (object tracks), episode npz small arrays, calls logs.\nOutput: outputs/verify/SL5g/failure_classes.json\n\nNumeric criteria (obs = observation index incl. wait; LI wait 20, LIBERO10 wait 10):\n  grasped(obs)  = both finger sides touch the target body (MuJoCo contact, dist <= 0)\n  lifted(obs)   = grasped and target z - z(wait) >= LIFT_MM\n  lost          = after the first lifted obs, >= LOST_RUN consecutive obs with no grasp and rise < LIFT_MM\n  over-lift     = max target rise > OVERLIFT_MM (VLA-only success episodes, both sets: max rise <= 186.3 mm)\nClasses (first match wins):\n  A_no_lift_hold     : never lifted, and longest HOLD run >= N_HOLD calls\n  A_no_lift_other    : never lifted, longest HOLD run < N_HOLD\n  B_lifted_lost      : lifted, lost\n  C_lifted_overlift  : lifted, not lost, max rise > OVERLIFT_MM\n  D_lifted_other     : lifted, not lost, max rise <= OVERLIFT_MM\n"
